    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 2 — Gridbreakers</strong></p><p><strong>“Everything broken still remembers how it worked.”</strong></p><p>Gridbreakers treat dead cities like sleeping machines. They know how to pry power from broken substations, wake lights in abandoned towers, and make a ruin choose sides. Where others see debris, they see leverage.</p><p><em>You’ve stopped scavenging ruins and started running them.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Your faction can restore or jury-rig infrastructure in Ruins/Urban Wreckage more efficiently. Facilities and urban systems are cheaper to reactivate, repair, or stabilize.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
